<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cons Afex year share jumps, dividend unchanged.</title>
<headline>Cons Afex year share jumps, dividend unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year/Half year ended</p>
<p>			(million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     30.87    vs   11.74</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  7.00    vs    7.00</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    0.68    vs    0.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    2.99    vs    2.05</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.03    vs    0.02</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    1.78    vs    1.44</p>
<p>    Turnover		  32.98    vs   28.15</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	1.25    vs    0.39 loss</p>
<p>Div payable: May 9</p>
<p>on register: March 27</p>
<p>Full name: Consolidated Afex Corporation Societe Anonyme</p>
<p>NOTE - There was a net credit from exceptional items following recovery of depreciation in the value of properties in the U.S. and certain portfolio realisations during the year</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
